{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/55992c7b036d576a80bd5333a687cb7d.avif?t=1761816253\" width=550 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.poster.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.webm?t=1761816253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.mp4?t=1761816253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> Welcome to a world where balance and chaos exist side by side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Madness VR</strong> is a fast, full-body VR battle arena where up to 4 players clash using the primal forces of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight feels alive, spells twist through the air, the ground shakes beneath your feet, and the world bends to your rhythm. It\u2019s not just about power; it\u2019s about flow, timing, and instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe in, move with purpose, and let the elements guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the arena, control isn\u2019t everything, <strong>connection</strong> is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/363fb5e0eb6e3fdb853ceb025c35977a.avif?t=1761816253\" width=456 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/272c7fab503238940ceb54d3f8199d54.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span><strong> </strong><br>Play as <strong>Brock Lee</strong>, <strong>Cobra Flash</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/109cc1ec137f75fb26084c4180d1979d.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or as your <strong>spirit animal character</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/cf032564689774885662d83c0d37251c.webp?t=1761816253\" width=615 height=34 /></span>Choose your <strong>spell loadouts</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/993757ef19a19a0423abce27927d3d30.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span>...and win the battle with your <strong>unique strategy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/461abf8c98bd75a6f26254f397ae0237.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements are living expressions of power, identity, and intent:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood</strong> embodies growth and renewal. It thrives through movement and adaptation, twisting and expanding with unending vitality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> is passion made power... wild, consuming, and ever-transforming. It destroys to create and burns to be reborn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth</strong> stands firm, unmovable and eternal. It is patience, resilience, and strength forged through stillness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metal</strong> is the edge of precision and discipline. Cold and deliberate, it strikes with perfect timing and unwavering resolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water</strong> flows with grace and intelligence, bending around resistance and reshaping the world through persistence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/2d873ca451290cb8ff225d532d55e0ff.webp?t=1761816253\" width=622 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/04e54e69b292341d5e020c2d32c188d0.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Dodge, throw, and strategize in real-time. Engage in <strong>intense battles</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, add up to <strong>4 bots</strong>, and use the integrated <strong>voice chat</strong> to coordinate with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/d0c44b0aeea4ac99eccf5f626cac576c.webp?t=1761816253\" width=515 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/60d01ccd7776131b33f614e12ce05dcf.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Personalize the lobby just the way you like it! With our <strong>VR Builder</strong>, you can design, modify, and bring your vision to life instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Arena &amp; Prove Your Skills!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549310?t=1761816253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549310?t=1761816253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/d176ea63167f2045b07d9544bda0bc586cafef52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761816253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/d176ea63167f2045b07d9544bda0bc586cafef52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761816253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/55992c7b036d576a80bd5333a687cb7d.avif?t=1761816253\" width=550 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.poster.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.webm?t=1761816253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/278755de074d1530ee1d7ae5d6204d66.mp4?t=1761816253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> Welcome to a world where balance and chaos exist side by side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Madness VR</strong> is a fast, full-body VR battle arena where up to 4 players clash using the primal forces of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight feels alive, spells twist through the air, the ground shakes beneath your feet, and the world bends to your rhythm. It\u2019s not just about power; it\u2019s about flow, timing, and instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe in, move with purpose, and let the elements guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the arena, control isn\u2019t everything, <strong>connection</strong> is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/363fb5e0eb6e3fdb853ceb025c35977a.avif?t=1761816253\" width=456 height=75 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/272c7fab503238940ceb54d3f8199d54.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span><strong> </strong><br>Play as <strong>Brock Lee</strong>, <strong>Cobra Flash</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/109cc1ec137f75fb26084c4180d1979d.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or as your <strong>spirit animal character</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/cf032564689774885662d83c0d37251c.webp?t=1761816253\" width=615 height=34 /></span>Choose your <strong>spell loadouts</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/993757ef19a19a0423abce27927d3d30.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span>...and win the battle with your <strong>unique strategy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/461abf8c98bd75a6f26254f397ae0237.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements are living expressions of power, identity, and intent:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood</strong> embodies growth and renewal. It thrives through movement and adaptation, twisting and expanding with unending vitality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> is passion made power... wild, consuming, and ever-transforming. It destroys to create and burns to be reborn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth</strong> stands firm, unmovable and eternal. It is patience, resilience, and strength forged through stillness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metal</strong> is the edge of precision and discipline. Cold and deliberate, it strikes with perfect timing and unwavering resolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water</strong> flows with grace and intelligence, bending around resistance and reshaping the world through persistence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/2d873ca451290cb8ff225d532d55e0ff.webp?t=1761816253\" width=622 height=34 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/04e54e69b292341d5e020c2d32c188d0.avif?t=1761816253\" width=616 height=204 /></span>Dodge, throw, and strategize in real-time. Engage in <strong>intense battles</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, add up to <strong>4 bots</strong>, and use the integrated <strong>voice chat</strong> to coordinate with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/extras/d0c44b0aeea4ac99eccf5f626ca